{"path":"index.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Integrative care with gentle rigor</title>
  <meta name="description" content="A thoughtful, personalised plan to help you study patterns, reduce friction, and move with clarity.">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/styles.css">
</head>
<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="wrap">
      <a class="brand" href="/">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</a>
      <nav class="nav">
        <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
        <a href="approach.html">Philosophy</a>
        <a href="conditions.html">Conditions</a>
        <a href="about.html">About</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Investment</a>
        <a href="book.html" class="cta">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
      </nav>
      <button class="nav-toggle" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Menu">☰</button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="hero-grid">
          <div>
            <h1>Care that sees context, not only details</h1>
            <p class="lead">We map daily rhythms, connective stressors, and practical supports—then co-create a stepwise plan you can live with.</p>
            <p class="meta">Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> • <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
            <p><a class="btn" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a></p>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-aside">
            <svg class="pattern" aria-hidden="true"><use href="assets/img/pattern.svg#p"></use></svg>
            <div class="card small">
              <strong>Quick intake</strong>
              <p>20-minute orientation call — a short conversation to see fit and next steps.</p>
              <a class="muted" href="book.html">Book orientation</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="diagnostic" class="diagnostic wrap">
      <h2>Where things are held</h2>
      <p class="sub">We begin with a focused review of patterns: sleep, stress load, movement, appetite, and social rhythm. It’s educational and non-judgmental.</p>
      <div class="cards">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Pattern review</h3>
          <p>Structured questions and simple tracking to reveal what repeats and what changes.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Context inventory</h3>
          <p>Life context—work, caregiving, environment—frames what is possible and what needs redesign.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Risk & safety check</h3>
          <p>Priorities for safety and immediate supports are never overlooked.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="plan" class="plan">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Three-phase roadmap</h2>
        <p class="sub">A scaffolded plan so change feels achievable: prepare, practice, integrate. Use the planner below to sketch timing and commitments.</p>

        <div class="timeline-planner" id="timelinePlanner" role="application" aria-label="Timeline planner">
          <div class="phases">
            <div class="phase" data-phase="1">
              <h4>Phase 1 — Ground</h4>
              <label>Duration (weeks): <input type="number" min="1" max="12" value="2" class="weeks"></label>
              <label><input type="checkbox" class="activity" value="sleep_review"> Sleep review</label>
              <label><input type="checkbox" class="activity" value="stress_tools"> Stress tools</label>
            </div>
            <div class="phase" data-phase="2">
              <h4>Phase 2 — Practice</h4>
              <label>Duration (weeks): <input type="number" min="1" max="24" value="6" class="weeks"></label>
              <label><input type="checkbox" class="activity" value="movement"> Movement habit</label>
              <label><input type="checkbox" class="activity" value="nutrition_changes"> Practical nutrition changes</label>
            </div>
            <div class="phase" data-phase="3">
              <h4>Phase 3 — Integrate</h4>
              <label>Duration (weeks): <input type="number" min="1" max="52" value="12" class="weeks"></label>
              <label><input type="checkbox" class="activity" value="routines"> Routines & supports</label>
              <label><input type="checkbox" class="activity" value="community"> Social supports</label>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="summary">
            <h4>Roadmap summary</h4>
            <div id="roadmapOutput">Total: 20 weeks • Focus: Ground → Practice → Integrate</div>
            <p class="disclaimer">This planner is educational. It does not replace clinical judgement. Timelines are flexible and individualized.</p>
            <p><a class="btn" href="book.html">Plan a detailed session</a></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="proof" class="proof wrap">
      <h2>Proof & perspective</h2>
      <p class="sub">Voices from people who used the approach, and institutions that inform our practice.</p>

      <div class="proof-grid">
        <div class="testimonials">
          <div class="testimonial-viewport" id="testimonialViewport" aria-live="polite"></div>
          <div class="controls">
            <button id="prevTest">‹</button>
            <button id="nextTest">›</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside class="badges" id="badgeArea">
          <div class="badge" data-tip="Peer-reviewed approaches inform our plans">🧪<span class="badge-label">Evidence</span></div>
          <div class="badge" data-tip="Collaborative networks and community resources">🏥<span class="badge-label">Network</span></div>
          <div class="badge" data-tip="Ongoing learning and continuing education">📚<span class="badge-label">Learning</span></div>
        </aside>
      </div>

      <div id="badgeTooltip" class="badge-tooltip" role="status" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    </section>

    <section id="micro_habits" class="micro wrap">
      <h2>Micro-habits, not heroic overhaul</h2>
      <p class="sub">Small, evidence-informed shifts that stack over time.</p>
      <ul class="habit-list">
        <li><strong>2-minute evening reset</strong> — tidy one corner, set tomorrow’s top 1.</li>
        <li><strong>3-breath check</strong> — pause before reactive choices.</li>
        <li><strong>10-minute movement</strong> — short, frequent sessions beat occasional extremes.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section id="pricing" class="pricing wrap">
      <h2>Investment & programs</h2>
      <p class="sub">We use a hybrid model: time + periodic guided cycles. Educational and transparency-first.</p>

      <div class="plans">
        <div class="plan-card">
          <h3>Starter Cycle</h3>
          <p>One intake + a single 6-week guided cycle. Ideal for focused shifts.</p>
          <div class="price">$450</div>
          <p><a class="muted" href="book.html">Start a cycle</a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="plan-card featured">
          <h3>Seasonal Path</h3>
          <p>Three guided cycles over six months with checkpoint reviews and habit coaching.</p>
          <div class="price">$1,200</div>
          <p><a class="muted" href="book.html">Enroll in a path</a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="plan-card">
          <h3>Care Partnership</h3>
          <p>Ongoing collaborative visits and on-demand check-ins for complex context.</p>
          <div class="price">$350 / month</div>
          <p><a class="muted" href="contact.html">Discuss fit</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="note">All programs are educational in nature. We do not promise cures. Plans are tailored and may change with new information.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="cta" class="cta wrap">
      <h2>Ready to begin?</h2>
      <p class="sub">A short call can clarify whether this approach fits your current goals and limits.</p>
      <p><a class="btn big" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a></p>
      <p class="local">Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} — remote options available.</p>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p>&copy; <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — All rights reserved.</p>
      <nav class="foot-nav">
        <a href="privacy.html">Privacy</a>
        <a href="terms.html">Terms</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src="assets/js/main.js"></script>
  <script>document.getElementById('year').textContent=new Date().getFullYear();</script>
</body>
</html>"} 
